<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games in the Spanish first division on Sunday:</p>
<p>Extremadura 2 (Juanito Rodriguez pen. 80th minute, Carlos Dure 90th) Atletico Madrid 4 (Daniel Prodan 23rd, Kiko Narvaez 65th, 67th, and Juan Carlos Gomez 70th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 8,000</p>
<p>Hercules 1 (Amato 12th) Sporting de Gijon 1 (Yuri Nikiforov 26th) 1-1. 12,000</p>
<p>Oviedo 2 (Pablo Maqueda 25th, Oli Alvarez 48th) Logrones 1 (Ruben Sosa 90th) 1-0. 11,000</p>
<p>Racing de Santander 1 (Ilsha Faizulin 75th) Tenerife 2 (Antonio Pinilla 22nd, Sergio Ballesteros 43rd) 0-2. 10,000</p>
<p>Real Sociedad 1 (Xabier Gracia 90th) Zaragoza 0. 0-0. 18,000</p>
<p>Espanyol 0 Compostela 2 (Cristopher Ohen 62nd, Fabiano Soares 83rd) 0-0. 14,000.</p>
<p>Real Madrid 1 (Raul Gonzalez 61st) Athletic Bilbao 0. 0-0. 45,000</p>
